{"title":"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">2008 AMC 12A #4</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">2008 AMC 10A #5</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is equal to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Product\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Product\">product</a>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/d/61d211dd54e4b681761aa2c6c2fea286d329138e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{8}{4}\\cdot\\frac{12}{8}\\cdot\\frac{16}{12}\\cdot\\cdots\\cdot\\frac{4n+4}{4n}\\cdot\\cdots\\cdot\\frac{2008}{2004}?\\]\" width=\"280\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/f/35fc5058c41c8cf6f88138585b64bcdad5dbd730.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 251\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 502\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1004\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2008\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4016$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"466\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/4/d4426435ea6f107a3943befa7bd7d38beeefb92c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {8}{4}\\cdot\\frac {12}{8}\\cdot\\frac {16}{12}\\cdots\\frac {4n + 4}{4n}\\cdots\\frac {2008}{2004} = \\frac {1}{4}\\cdot\\left(\\frac {8}{8}\\cdot\\frac {12}{12}\\cdots\\frac {4n}{4n}\\cdots\\frac {2004}{2004}\\right)\\cdot 2008 = \\frac{2008}{4} =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"610\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/8/8c80fc4dae7384417061880b9e40261b8728adfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$502 \\Rightarrow B$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that everything cancels out except for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> in the numerator and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the denominator.\n</p><p>Thus, the product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fdd48641201f7d05a88da4e33a2bd6f9315a6ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2008}{4}=502$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b7193f66028e13f331d53ff5e6942c4b05587465.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A\">2008 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/